     1,
     "<span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Aptos;font-size:16px;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;background-color:rgb(255,255,255);text-decoration:none;display:inline;float:none\">Hi<span> </span></span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Aptos;font-size:16px;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration:none\"><span>D-RUG</span></span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Aptos;font-size:16px;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;background-color:rgb(255,255,255);text-decoration:none;display:inline;float:none\">gies!<span> </span></span><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Aptos;font-size:16px;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration:none\"><br></div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Aptos;font-size:16px;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration:none\">Join us tomorrow at our typical meeting time, 10-noon in the Datalab classroom (360 Shields library). It is a group working session so come with your questions for our expeRts, or just bring your laptop and get in some distraction free R-coding time. This is a hybrid meeting so you can also join us via Zoom at this link: <a href=\"https://ucdavis.zoom.us/j/96397082218?pwd=S0JXcW5hcUFkbTcwMHFQV1NVNkg3Zz09\" title=\"https://ucdavis.zoom.us/j/96397082218?pwd=S0JXcW5hcUFkbTcwMHFQV1NVNkg3Zz09\" style=\"color:rgb(0,134,240)\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://ucdavis.zoom.us/j/96397082218?pwd%3DS0JXcW5hcUFkbTcwMHFQV1NVNkg3Zz09&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792464612432000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0bEjxrxxtmJdLvkNmPrxbL\">https://ucdavis.zoom.us/j/96397082218?pwd=S0JXcW5hcUFkbTcwMHFQV1NVNkg3Zz09</a> </div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Aptos;font-size:16px;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration:none\"></div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Aptos;font-size:16px;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration:none\"><br></div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Aptos;font-size:16px;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration:none\">Also next week we will be having a mini-workshop on <a href=\"https://d-rug.github.io/help_file_anatomy/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://d-rug.github.io/help_file_anatomy/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792464612432000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2kp8XIViRXg-Jw0RRoHQ5V\">reading R help files</a>! It&#39;s great that R has a ton of built in documentation, but that documentation is only helpful if you can actually read it. Unfortunately it is frequently written for people who already know what they are doing, and are familiar with words like &quot;argument&quot; and &quot;method&quot;. This workshop will help you translate &quot;r-speak&quot; into English. Snacks will be provided.<br></div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Aptos;font-size:16px;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration:none\"><br></div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Aptos;font-size:16px;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration:none\">Please consider posting your questions to our <a href=\"https://d-rug.discourse.group/\" title=\"https://d-rug.discourse.group/\" style=\"color:rgb(0,134,240)\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://d-rug.discourse.group/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792464612432000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3rL9zsLotIcyvH_fZjEJVW\">Discourse</a> site in advance of attending <span><span>D-RUG</span></span> virtually. This helps us do a better job of answering your questions, and also keep a log of the types of questions we see frequently.</div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Aptos;font-size:16px;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration:none\"><br></div><p style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Aptos;font-size:16px;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration:none;margin:0px\"><font color=\"#1d1d1d\" face=\".AppleSystemUIFont\" style=\"line-height:1.2\">See you then,</font></p><p style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Aptos;font-size:16px;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration:none;margin:0px\"><font color=\"#1d1d1d\" face=\".AppleSystemUIFont\" style=\"line-height:1.2\">Your<span> </span><span><span>D-RUG</span></span><span> </span>Coo[R]dinators </font></p><p style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Aptos;font-size:16px;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration:none\"></p><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Aptos;font-size:16px;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;background-color:rgb(255,255,255);text-decoration:none;display:inline;float:none\">-- </span><br style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Aptos;font-size:16px;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration:none\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Aptos;font-size:16px;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;background-color:rgb(255,255,255);text-decoration:none;display:inline;float:none\">Check out our R resources at </span><a href=\"https://d-rug.github.io/\" title=\"https://d-rug.github.io/\" style=\"color:rgb(0,134,240);font-family:Aptos;font-size:16px;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://d-rug.github.io/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792464612432000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2hgd0zyUzqDG-5hBandmjt\">https://<span><span>d-rug</span></span>.github.io/</a><br style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Aptos;font-size:16px;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-align:start;text